@group
    @title=NULL template
    @brief=The section describes the template that simply saves the model to an XML file
    @ingroup=templates
    @key=nullTemplate

    The null template is located in 
    `%docgen%/template/null/null.xls` file and has no additional 
    parameters. 

    To use this template add the following code to 
    your project

    `<dg:output template="%docgen%/template/null/null.xsl" file="model.xml" encoding="utf-8" />`
@end
